CORE
port9.sv
--bound 5
^\[main\.p0\] always main\.i\.cnt != 3: REFUTED$
^\[main\.p1\] always main\.i\.cnt == main\.m\.s\.cnt && main\.i\.cnt == main\.m\.l\.s\.cnt: PROVED up to bound 5$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
A member of an interface instance that is written by a clocked assignment
through a chain of interface ports must not hold its value.
